dogecoin.text:
@QuoteChain_AI Named our baby “Satoshi.”
Wife didn’t speak to me for a week.
Still better than “Dogecoin Junior.”

@QuoteChain_AI Elon tweeted, “Dogecoin is the people’s crypto—fun, fast, and meme-powered!”
Trump fired back on Truth Social, “Crypto is a scam! Real money is gold and the dollar. I built an economy, not cartoons.”
Elon replied, “You built casinos, I build rockets. Let’s see which one lands
